Dear Team,
We are pleased to inform you that the No Objection Certificate (NOC) has been successfully generated. Please find the details below:
Customer Name: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.Name}
Loan Account Number: {!$Record.EYI_Loan_Account_Number__c}
Property Details: {!$Record.EYI_Project__r.Name}
NOC Generation Date: {!TodaysDate}

Dear {!$Record.EYI_Closing_Manager__r.LastName}

We are pleased to inform you that the Loan Status is NOC Generated. Please provide with Signed NOC Letter.

Please find the details below:
Customer Name: {!$Record.EYI_Opportunity__r.Name}
Loan Account Number: {!$Record.EYI_Loan_Account_Number__c}

Thank you,
Panchshil Team

